   1          /* =====================================================
   2             U1 - TRUNG TAM DIEU KHIEN GOI TANG
   3             AT89C52, thach anh 11.0592MHz
   4          
   5             - Doc nut goi tang (P1) + nut cabin (P2)
   6             - Xu ly logic thang may + thoi gian cua
   7             - Hien thi thong bao tren LCD 16x2 (che do 4 bit)
   8                 D4..D7 = P0.0..P0.3 (BIT1..BIT4, co dien tro keo len)
   9                 RS = P3.2, RW = P3.3, E = P3.4
  10             - Gui lenh + so tang sang U4 qua UART
  11               (U1 P3.1 TXD  --->  U4 P3.0 RXD)
